<title>UK: Mirror Group H1 pre-tax, pre-excep rises.</title>
<headline>Mirror Group H1 pre-tax, pre-excep rises.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr, pre-excep (pence)  6.7		   vs 6.5</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	  1.35		  vs 1.2</p>
<p> Pretax, pre-excep	 39.0		  vs 37.9</p>
<p> Turnover		   277.3		  vs 247.9</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts' forecasts on pre-tax profits were in a range of 32.5 to 41 million stg.</p>
</text>
